WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.728 --> 00:00:15.215
The next morning, the police let Geppetto go back to his house.

2
00:00:15.936 --> 00:00:21.258
Meanwhile, Pinocchio was at home crying because he was tired and hungry and had no clothes.

3
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.622
When Geppetto came home, he was very angry with Pinocchio for running away.

4
00:00:27.642 --> 00:00:30.784
"You are a bad boy, Pinocchio.

5
00:00:31.476 --> 00:00:34.658
You must honor me and obey me," Geppetto said.

6
00:00:34.678 --> 00:00:36.219
"Yes, Father.

7
00:00:36.239 --> 00:00:38.881
I am sorry," said Pinocchio.

8
00:00:40.002 --> 00:00:42.984
Earlier that morning, he had decided to try to be a good boy.

9
00:00:43.624 --> 00:00:45.486
Being a bad boy was not much fun.

10
00:00:46.206 --> 00:00:48.768
He also knew Geppetto would feed him if he was sorry.

11
00:00:48.788 --> 00:00:52.951
"I missed you last night, Father," Pinocchio said.

12
00:00:53.571 --> 00:00:54.311
It was true, too.

13
00:00:56.453 --> 00:00:59.495
He had wished Geppetto had been there to feed him and make him happy.

14
00:01:00.436 --> 00:01:02.421
Instead, he had been cold and hungry.

15
00:01:03.041 --> 00:01:04.561
And that cricket had made him cry.

16
00:01:05.202 --> 00:01:07.783
Geppetto's heart was happy when he heard his son had missed him.

17
00:01:09.804 --> 00:01:11.845
He did not want to be angry with Pinocchio.

18
00:01:11.865 --> 00:01:14.466
"Poor boy," he said.

19
00:01:14.486 --> 00:01:16.066
"You look tired.

20
00:01:16.586 --> 00:01:20.588
You must be hungry with no food, and cold with no clothes.

21
00:01:21.629 --> 00:01:25.190
Let's eat breakfast, and then, we'll make you something to wear."

22
00:01:27.691 --> 00:01:29.732
Geppetto pulled three pears from his pocket.

23
00:01:30.336 --> 00:01:31.737
He had picked them on the way home.

24
00:01:32.357 --> 00:01:35.259
But, before he could take a bite, Pinocchio ate all three!

25
00:01:35.279 --> 00:01:39.121
"Oh! I am still hungry!"

26
00:01:39.601 --> 00:01:40.542
Pinocchio complained.

27
00:01:40.562 --> 00:01:43.523
"Well, you shouldn't waste food.

28
00:01:44.144 --> 00:01:46.445
Finish the cores," Geppetto said.

29
00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:49.306
Pinocchio ate the cores.

30
00:01:49.326 --> 00:01:50.987
"You're right, Father.

31
00:01:51.368 --> 00:01:52.528
That is much better.

32
00:01:53.389 --> 00:01:55.470
What did you eat for breakfast today?"

33
00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:59.312
"Your smile," Geppetto replied.

34
00:02:00.152 --> 00:02:03.133
Pinocchio realized he had eaten all of Geppetto's food!

35
00:02:04.873 --> 00:02:05.634
"Oh, Father!

36
00:02:05.654 --> 00:02:08.054
I'm sorry for eating your food.

37
00:02:08.374 --> 00:02:09.254
I didn't think!

38
00:02:09.755 --> 00:02:11.175
How selfish of me.

39
00:02:11.915 --> 00:02:14.096
I promise to do anything you ask.

40
00:02:14.596 --> 00:02:16.817
I'll even go to school, if you want."

41
00:02:16.837 --> 00:02:19.697
"Really?" asked Geppetto.

42
00:02:20.237 --> 00:02:22.238
He was happy his boy was learning some manners.

43
00:02:23.398 --> 00:02:26.259
"Yes, but first I need to buy a schoolbook.

44
00:02:26.799 --> 00:02:28.060
May I have some money?"

45
00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:29.360
Pinocchio asked.

46
00:02:30.236 --> 00:02:33.559
"Oh, I don't have any money," Geppetto said sadly.

47
00:02:33.579 --> 00:02:35.620
"But don't worry.

48
00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.481
I'll make sure you get a book."

49
00:02:38.062 --> 00:02:39.903
And he put on his coat and left the house.

50
00:02:43.306 --> 00:02:46.508
He returned a short time later and gave Pinocchio his first book.

51
00:02:47.088 --> 00:02:51.171
Pinocchio took the book from Geppetto and noticed he was no longer wearing his coat.

52
00:02:51.191 --> 00:02:53.133
"Thank you for the book.

53
00:02:53.933 --> 00:02:56.055
But, Father, where is your coat?"

54
00:02:56.575 --> 00:02:57.436
Pinocchio asked.

55
00:02:59.016 --> 00:03:00.638
"Oh, I don't need a coat.

56
00:03:01.058 --> 00:03:05.582
I'm too warm these days," Geppetto answered, looking down at the floor.

57
00:03:06.183 --> 00:03:08.685
Geppetto had sold his coat to buy Pinocchio a book!

58
00:03:09.185 --> 00:03:10.987
Pinocchio cried tears of happiness.

59
00:03:11.007 --> 00:03:14.550
"Oh, thank you, Father!"

60
00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:15.751
he said.

61
00:03:16.411 --> 00:03:18.133
He gave Geppetto a big hug.

62
00:03:18.153 --> 00:03:21.776
"Now, how about some clothes?"

63
00:03:22.236 --> 00:03:23.077
Geppetto asked.

64
00:03:23.497 --> 00:03:26.140
They worked the rest of the day to make Pinocchio's clothes.

65
00:03:26.754 --> 00:03:28.713
Tomorrow was his first day of school.
